  "description": "Establishes three analytically independent sufficient conditions under which EFC reduces exactly to LCDM or GR: (i) parameter limit alpha_L2 -> 0; (ii) low-entropy regime S < S_c; (iii) density saturation rho >> rho_crit. Proves EFC contains LCDM as a limiting case in the perturbation sector.",
